<section id="1002J_S000U" variety="S000U">
<name>Brake Control</name>
<ttl id="1002J_S000U_744TG_T0089" variety="T0089">
<name>ABS with EBD &amp; TRC &amp; VSC &amp; BA System</name>
<para id="RM00000060700VX" category="C" type-id="3007J" name-id="442OG-00" from="200612">
<dtccode>C0278/11</dtccode>
<dtcname>ABS Solenoid Relay Circuit Open</dtcname>
<dtccode>C0279/12</dtccode>
<dtcname>ABS Solenoid Relay Circuit Short</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM00000060700VX_05" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00007MV00000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The solenoid relay supplies power to the ABS solenoids and TRC solenoids.</ptxt>
<ptxt>The relay turns ON approximately 1.5 seconds after the IG is turned ON, and turns OFF if an open or short in a solenoid is detected by the self-diagnosis at the start of driving.</ptxt>
<ptxt>The solenoid relay is built into the actuator assembly.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.47in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.95in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.66in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Output Related Items</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C0278/11</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>When the solenoid relay is ON with IG1 terminal voltage at 9.5V or higher, the solenoid relay contact remains OFF for 0.2 seconds or more</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>When the relay is driven ON, IG1 terminal voltage drops below 9.5V and 0.2 seconds or more elapse without the relay contact turning ON</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Low voltage to solenoid relay power source (+BS terminal)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Open in wire harness</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Poor connector contact pressure, terminal deformation or corrosion</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Open in solenoid relay circuit in actuator assembly</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C0279/12</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Immediately after the IG is turned ON, when the solenoid relay is OFF, the contact in the solenoid relay remains ON for 4 seconds or more</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Open in solenoid relay circuit in actuator assembly</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000060700VX_06" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00007MW00000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C146384J02" width="7.106578999in" height="6.791605969in"/>
