</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000060700VX_07" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000060700VX_08" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM00000060700VX_08_0008" proc-id="RM0550J___00007MX00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Fuse (ABS No.3 30A)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using the SST (Toyota electrical tester), inspect the fuse (ABS No.3 30A).</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.75in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.24in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.14in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>ABS No.3 Fuse</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000060700VX_08_0009" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM00000060700VX_08_0012" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000060700VX_08_0009" proc-id="RM0550J___00007MY00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness and Connector (Solenoid Relay Power Source System)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check that the brake actuator assembly connector is properly engaged.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>No malfunction</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn the IG OFF and disconnect the brake actuator assembly connector.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check that the connector case and terminals are free of deformation and corrosion.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>No deformation or corrosion</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using the SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance and voltage between the wire harness side connector of the brake actuator assembly and body ground.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C146352J11" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.76in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.20in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.17in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>1 (GND1) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<spec>
<title>Voltage</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.75in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.18in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.20in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>12 (+BS) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>10 to 14V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000060700VX_08_0010" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM00000060700VX_08_0013" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000060700VX_08_0010" proc-id="RM0550J___00007MZ00000">
<scantool type="1"/>
<testtitle>Recheck DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Clear the DTCs. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000060000PX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn the IG OFF → ON and check that the ABS warning light comes on for approximately 3 seconds and then goes off.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn the IG OFF → ON and drive at a vehicle speed of 6km/h or more.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>If the ABS warning light remains on, check the DTCs. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM00000060000PX"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.47in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.66in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>OK</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Malfunction Code</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>After the IG is turned ON, the skid control computer performs self-diagnosis of the solenoid circuits when a vehicle speed of 6km/h or more is input with the stop light switch OFF.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If the normal code is output, lightly vibrate the connectors, wires and fuse of the actuator assembly and check that no malfunction code is output.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If a malfunction code is output due to vibration, inspect and repair the connector or wire harness in the relevant area.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000060700VX_08_0011" fin="true">A</down>
<right ref="RM00000060700VX_08_0014" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000060700VX_08_0011">
<testtitle>Perform Problem Reproduction Test<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000ABY03DX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000060700VX_08_0012">
<testtitle>Replace Fuse</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000060700VX_08_0013">
<testtitle>Repair or Replace Wire Harness or Connector</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000060700VX_08_0014">
<testtitle>Replace ABS &amp; Traction Actuator Assembly<xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000304V000X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
